WEBVTT

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.490
Mister!

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.690
That armor!

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.490
It's the mark of a Trump Kingdom warrior!

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:14.230
What were you to the princess?

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:17.940
My name is Jonathan Klondike.

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:21.010
Princess Ann's fiancé.

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:25.920
The princess's fiancé?

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:33.220
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.700
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:38.570
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:40.600
Every day it sparkles

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:44.310
Dokidoki Precure

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:51.160
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:56.830
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.480
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:07.930
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:13.640
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:22.490
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:24.170
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:26.570
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:29.420
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:32.220
What's more than just cute

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:36.090
is our promise between girls

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:42.130
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:48.040
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:54.000
Solitaire

00:01:56.350 --> 00:01:57.760
Help yourselves.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:07.910
Now, ask away.

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:14.490
There's so much to ask, I don't know where to begin!

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:17.830
So you know about Ai and the Royal Crystals?

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:21.190
Is it true that you're the princess's fiancé?

00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:24.760
I'll answer one at a time.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:25.660
First off...

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:34.870
I'm a survivor from Trump Kingdom, just like you.

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:39.230
"Joe Okada" was simply a persona I assumed to blend into this world.

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:40.070
Next,

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:43.540
I've seen these Royal Crystals before.

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:46.150
I knew they were real right away.

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:47.910
So they <i>were</i> real.

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:49.520
Thank goodness.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:51.890
So, what about Ai?

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:54.100
Beats me!

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:58.530
I can say that I picked up her egg by the river.

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:01.530
She's a strange baby.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:05.150
You're not playing dumb again, are you?

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:06.960
No trust, huh?

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:09.610
It's 'cause you always act suspicious!

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:13.140
And lastly, my relationship with Ann.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:18.280
We most certainly did vow to spend the rest of our lives together.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:24.890
I never heard a word of this from the princess!

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:29.130
I suppose not.

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:31.540
This was before you served under Ann.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:34.740
Don't refer to the princess with pet names!

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:37.200
Hey now, let's calm down...

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.300
Going back, there's one thing I must mention.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.790
There are five Royal Crystals in total.

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:47.720
When all five are gathered,

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:49.790
a miraculous trump card will appear.

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:53.420
A miraculous trump card?

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:54.720
What's that?

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:57.460
I don't know the details, either.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:05.430
All I can say for certain is that we should gather the crystals and save Trump Kingdom.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.350
You're right.

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:12.630
If we put off the one that Regina took,

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:15.730
there's only one crystal remaining.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:18.900
But we've got no idea where it is.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:20.140
And for that, I have...

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:21.780
this.

