00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:24.830
What's this?

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:26.230
A travel guide.

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:29.430
This is no time for a vacation!

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:33.220
A steam train and a rape blossom field?

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:36.590
They're photos of a train on a scenic railroad.

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:41.060
This scenery looks much like a place that holds many memories for Ann and I.

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:43.580
A place that... holds memories?

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:48.170
He's the one that found it.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:51.970
A trip, huh?

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:54.780
I understand!

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:57.420
Now, I'll go pack some lunches!

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:59.380
My, how exciting!

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:01.260
Oh, you two.

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:02.350
I guess we're going.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:08.160
The final clue to the princess...

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:16.290
 It's Appeared!

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:16.290
 It's Appeared!

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:22.000
So this was a treasure handed down in the Trump Kingdom...

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.920
I'll be the judge of that.

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:28.450
Oh, what fine craftsmanship.

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:31.120
What would <i>you</i> know?

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:33.110
Just let me decide.

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:36.110
Hey, I'm not lettin' you swoop in and nab it!

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:38.520
I'm doing no such thing, so let go!

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:43.890
I can't let you mishandle that.

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:46.800
It's mine, after all.

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:49.470
So pretty...

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:53.240
This radiance belongs to me.

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:55.540
Yes, all of it.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:59.270
What's eating her?

00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:49.520
What a beautiful train!

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:51.560
It feels so dignified!

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:18.800
It's slower paced than a normal train.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:21.360
That's what makes it charming!

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:22.780
Time for lunch!

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:24.420
Finally!

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.260
Ta-dah! Peach buns!

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:29.620
I made them with Dad!

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:32.310
We made plenty, so have as much as you like!

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:33.840
Don't mind if we do!

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:37.080
Here you go.

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.040
No thanks.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:40.010
Let's drink 
together!

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:40.010
Let's drink 
together!

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:43.980
I brought my own.

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:45.250
I see.

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:47.430
Is Makopi upset?

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:49.850
A maiden's heart is complex indeed.

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:51.720
Thanks for the food!

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:54.400
That was yummy.

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:00.560
Amazing!

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:02.830
Wait!

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:05.090
This wasn't a trip for pleasure!

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:05.870
You're right!

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:07.270
We've gotta look for that crystal!

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:13.180
Kyupirappa!

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:20.880
What's that?

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:24.640
What the...

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:25.690
Don't tell me...

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:27.340
Ai?!

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:32.500
That's weird...

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:35.420
We'll do a quick inspection just to be safe.

00:08:35.420 --> 00:08:39.700
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:38.840
Why are you apologizing, ma'am?

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:43.490
Can't have a trip without a bit of trouble.

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:44.680
Mister, where are you...

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:46.550
Just a stroll.

00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:48.670
We came all this way, so you should come too.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.380
But we should wait here!

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:53.720
Impatience won't get you the crystal any faster!

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:58.320
Knowing his past doesn't make him any less unpredictable.

00:08:58.980 --> 00:08:59.590
Ai!

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:04.490
Let's go, girls.

00:09:23.260 --> 00:09:25.120
It's amazing!

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:27.920
This is the scenery he was talking about?

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:31.890
Ai may have lead us here.

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:36.650
It's just like Trump Kingdom when it was peaceful!

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:38.000
Is that so?

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:38.590
Yeah.

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:53.430
Can I have a minute?

00:09:54.430 --> 00:09:55.430
Certainly.

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:02.380
You know,

00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:05.650
back when we first met in the Clover Tower,

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:08.820
I thought you were a pretty strange person.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.800
You never answered our questions clearly,

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:16.650
but for some reason, I never disliked you. {Oh boy, confession time. Rikka's life is NTR.}

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:24.070
I'm sure that's because you were always showing us the way.

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:26.780
You're overestimating me.

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:31.940
The only ones who can defeat King Selfish and save Trump Kingdom

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:34.210
are the legendary Precure warriors.

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:37.990
The strength you've gained until your search for the crystals

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.890
was earned by your own efforts, and nobody else's.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:52.200
Just a bit longer...

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:57.440
What was the princess like?

00:10:57.740 --> 00:10:59.640
Makopi never told you?

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:03.350
I want to hear it from her lover!

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:07.900
You've got me there.

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:10.020
It's a bit of a long story, okay?

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:32.570
Hmm, the Ann that I knew...

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:33.510
Princess!

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:35.330
Where's the princess?

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:36.210
Here!

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:39.980
Though a swift stream

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:41.050
Princ—

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.020
What in the world are you doing?

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:46.560
Yet divided, it speeds on
 and at last, unites again

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:46.560
Karuta.

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:48.800
It's a game from the human world.

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:54.400
She was a bit tomboyish, but still a lovely woman.

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:58.030
Ann was as curious as they come,

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:00.670
and was interested in cultures from around the world.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:05.760
It's missing something...

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:06.770
Would this do?

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:14.050
I was a warrior in her service.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:16.830
It's quite wonderful.

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:54.630
It didn't take long for us to fall for one another.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:03.360
Soon after,

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:07.190
I was ordered to defend a faraway region.

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:09.410
I had no choice but to part from the castle.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:31.560
But then...

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:35.960
that nightmare began.

00:13:39.470 --> 00:13:40.950
Selfish!

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:49.920
Ann...

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:52.150
Ann...

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:05.070
Ann!

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.390
Selfish!

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:09.640
Selfish!

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:11.070
Selfish!

00:14:34.690 --> 00:14:36.340
Ann, where are you?

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:46.470
Is this...

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:51.770
Ann is in the world beyond...

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:01.660
Trump Kingdom... Ann...

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:05.760
Cure Sword wasn't the only one who couldn't save anyone.

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:07.260
I failed too.

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:10.840
Sorry.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:13.150
It wasn't a very happy story.

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.430
I'm glad I heard it.

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:21.070
We should get back to the station.

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:24.030
Was that enough for you?

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:28.940
I swear we'll meet Ann again.

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:31.910
Yes.

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.360
Hey, kid!

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:42.780
What are you doing?

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:44.390
Lemme drive!

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:45.460
No, you can't!

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:48.570
I wanna drive!

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:52.670
I know how you feel!

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:54.470
You wanna do what you wanna do!

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:06.300
I'll turn you into a splendid Selfish!

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:20.160
Locomotive Selfish!

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:22.730
Chugga Coupling!

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:26.800
Is that...

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:30.740
Selfiiiiiiish! {Jikochoo-choo}

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:32.210
It's a Selfish!

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:34.410
It's a train now?!

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:35.960
Selfish!

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:40.750
The flower field! {I don't feel the need to put rapeseed twice}

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:42.470
We have to stop it!

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:45.690
Charles!

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:49.620
Precure Love Link!

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:51.360
L-O-V-E!

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:52.080
L-O-V-E!

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:52.790
L-O-V-E!

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:53.990
L-O-V-E!

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:21.770
Brimming with love,

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:23.800
Cure Heart!

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:28.120
The light of wisdom,

00:17:29.050 --> 00:17:30.460
Cure Diamond!

00:17:32.890 --> 00:17:34.370
The warmth of the sun,

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:37.040
Cure Rosetta!

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:39.840
The blade of courage,

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:41.920
Cure Sword!

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:47.100
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.430
Dokidoki Precure!

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.790
Oh poor train who has lost his love,

00:17:54.310 --> 00:17:55.970
I, Cure Heart,

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:59.400
will make your heart race once more!

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:01.500
Hi, Mana!

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:03.080
Regina!

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:06.970
I came to take all the crystals from you.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.300
Well, we won't let you!

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:11.420
Resistance is futile, you know.

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:13.630
'Cause I'll just take them by force.

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:16.100
Mister!

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:18.000
Leave her to me!

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:20.390
You girls stop that Selfish!

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:21.450
Good luck!

00:18:22.010 --> 00:18:24.890
Stay out of my way, mister!

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:29.520
Return that crystal, if you'd please.

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:30.730
No way.

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:32.490
It belongs to me.

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:35.300
Then you leave me no choice.

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:45.690
Please stop!

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:47.990
How is it running without a railroad?

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:49.480
You're supposed to be a train!

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:51.760
Point! However...

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:54.880
I'm too off the rails to be railroaded!

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.720
That's absurd!

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:58.270
No matter who tries,

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:01.730
they ain't stopping the Selfish train! {The Rape Blossom Train has no brakes}

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:07.420
SELFIIIIIIIIIISH!

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:13.840
If this keeps up...

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:23.360
Cure Heart!

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:24.480
What are you planning?

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:32.690
SELFIIIIISH!

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:37.530
Full speed ahead!

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:45.120
You can't go any further!

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:50.060
I won't let you harm...

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:52.870
his memories!

00:20:00.650 --> 00:20:04.290
I swear that we'll meet the princess!

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:06.160
Love Heart Arrow!

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:16.660
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:19.270
Self?

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:24.810
Seeelf!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:33.080
Selfish!

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:43.350
Precure Lovely Force Arrow!

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:05.160
Love love loooooove!

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:12.020
Huh? I lost already?

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:13.460
What now?

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:14.730
Want to continue?

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:19.090
I'm kinda bored...

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:19.930
so nah!

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:21.290
See ya!

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:38.350
Thank goodness, the train's safe.

00:21:47.150 --> 00:21:48.190
This is...

00:21:48.190 --> 00:21:49.860
The final crystal!

00:21:49.860 --> 00:21:51.080
We've done it!

